{
  "name": "ledgerly",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Controls-grade, multi-tenant general ledger with modern SaaS UX. Laravel 12 \u00b7 Inertia 2 \u00b7 React 19 / TypeScript \u00b7 Tailwind 4 \u00b7 PostgreSQL 16 (Row-Level Security) \u00b7 Redis \u00b7 Horizon.",
